      sourceNote: "Representative current U.S. labels and 2022 AHA/ACC/HFSA guidance: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/lookup.cfm?setid=916de29e-228c-4dfc-bcee-ad9a641316bd ; https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/lookup.cfm?setid=c525ef20-ec9a-4ffd-b5ea-e53c186fe716 ; https://professional.heart.org/-/media/832EA0F4E73948848612F228F7FA2D35.pdf",
      tags: ["frontier-wave15", "nephron", "diuretic site map", "NKCC2", "NCC", "ENaC", "V2 receptor", "carbonic anhydrase", "osmotic diuretic"]
